<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Connecticut 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$1.04 million Pilot Pen International Tennis Championships on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>2-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Nicolas Lapentti</p>
<p>(Ecuador) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Vince Spadea (U.S.) leads Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 5-7</p>
<p>6-3 3-1, suspended due to darkness</p>
</text>
